  "graph": {
    "name": "SoftChef: Building AWS Iot Application Using an Innovative, Fully Serverless Architecture (Mandarin)",
    "link": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FHdtOtznWuA",
    "categories": "control",
    "graph_usable": true,
    "notes": "SaaS for IoT firmware deployment.\n    Migrate traditional hardware/IoT companies to Cloud.\n    Cognito, Lambda, ApiGateway, IoTCore, DynamoDB are under customer's account. This improves the safety (SoftChef cannot see the customer's data).\n    The number of IoT devices are at the order of 10k+, which cares load balancing and auto-scaling. This favors the serverless architecture. Meanwhile, when the number of devices is small, the cost is also relatively low."
  },
